  "summary": "社群媒體的無限滾動：",
  "content": "<p>社群媒體的無限滾動：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://wiwi.blog/assets/images/social-small-a4d77b4dbaef1d349d436af80d1d8451.png\" width=\"700\" height=\"489\"></p>\n<p>個人部落格世界：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://wiwi.blog/assets/images/blog-small-12ce1f3b130f001c4d0b13c924cbde0d.png\" width=\"700\" height=\"493\"></p>\n<p>何必嘗試在垃圾堆裡尋寶？手工精選商品店明明就在眼前。</p>\n<p><strong>來探索豐富的個人部落格世界吧</strong>！試試看從這些地方開始：<a href=\"https://poya.school/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Poya</a>、<a href=\"https://www.jaron.tw/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Jaron</a>、<a href=\"https://life.huli.tw/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Huli</a>、<a href=\"https://ikukaroom.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Ikuka</a>、<a href=\"https://skyhong.tw/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Sky</a>、<a href=\"https://www.wen-lab.tw/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Wen</a>、<a href=\"https://chswei.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Wei</a>、<a href=\"https://revolc.blog/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Revol</a>、<a href=\"https://blog.kalan.dev/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Kalan</a>、<a href=\"https://itshaun.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Shaun</a>、<a href=\"https://www.lukehong.tw/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Luke</a>、<a href=\"https://blog.gtisland.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Eddie</a>、<a href=\"https://blog.giveanornot.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">JN</a>、<a href=\"https://blog.kianting.info/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Yoxem</a>、<a href=\"https://blog.gslin.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">gslin</a>、<a href=\"https://yaxuanhe.me/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">雅瑄</a>、<a href=\"https://taiwan.chtsai.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">蔡志浩</a>、<a href=\"https://igouist.github.io/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">伊果</a>、<a href=\"https://fgzblog.com/zh-tw/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">范剛哲</a>、<a href=\"https://kiantiong.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">陳建中</a>、<a href=\"https://sheracaolity.ghost.io/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">詹雨安</a>、<a href=\"https://alexhsu.com/zh/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">駉</a>、<a href=\"https://trashposts.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">廢文小天地</a>⋯⋯</p>\n<p><em>（如果<a href=\"https://wiwi.blog/blog/comparing-spouses\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">檸檬卷</a>也可以寫一個就更完美了！）</em></p>\n<div><div>2025-08-24 更新</div><div><p>我已經把更多連結整理到「<a href=\"https://wiwi.blog/blogroll\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">部落卷 <code>/blogroll</code></a>」頁面囉！請過去那邊看最新的連結。</p></div></div>\n<p>以上只是我 <a href=\"https://wiwi.blog/blog/you-should-use-rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">RSS 閱讀器</a>裡的冰山一角（如果我遺漏了你的部落格，請原諒我），以後我再來好好整理成一頁專門的清單。</p>\n<p><strong>網路遠比你想像的廣闊，別讓 YT/FB/IG 這幾個網站成為你的全世界</strong>。離開這些演算法監牢，到外面呼吸新鮮空氣吧！</p>",
